# B FLAT MINOR PENTATONIC - a scale to hear, play along with, and read. Made by PokeyTracker's
# scale songs (File > New scale song), by rule: every note follows from the scale's steps.
# Five notes, the natural minor without its second and sixth: the scale of rock and blues solos.
# Going up:   Bb3 Db4 Eb4 F4 Ab4 Bb4
# The format is in Demo1/CLAUDE.md, under "Song files".

song   B FLAT MINOR PENTATONIC
key    B FLAT MINOR

# A soft piano-like voice on the 16-bit table: every note within two cents of true.
instrument PIANO
  table      wide
  volume     14 13 12 11 10 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 7 6
  distortion tone
  release    3

instrument HOME_NOTE
  table      wide
  volume     7 7 6
  distortion tone
  release    2

channel 1 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of channel 2's 16-bit divider. AUDCTL 78 joins 1 and 2, and 3 and 4.

channel 2 notes HOME
  note  The home note, held low under the scale when the drone is on - every note of the
  note  scale is heard against it, which is how a scale's character is learned. The lines
  note  play it where they name HOME; put . there to leave it out.
  voice HOME_NOTE
  track HOME Bb1 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 3 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of channel 4's 16-bit divider.

channel 4 notes SCALE
  note  B Flat Minor Pentatonic: one octave up and down in quarter notes, two in eighths,
  note  and the home chord as an arpeggio.
  voice PIANO
  track O1 Bb3 . . .  Db4 . . .  Eb4 . . .  F4 . . .
  track O2 Ab4 . . .  Bb4 . . .  Ab4 . . .  F4 . . .
  track O3 Eb4 . . .  Db4 . . .  Bb3 . . .  . . . .
  track T1 Bb3 . Db4 .  Eb4 . F4 .  Ab4 . Bb4 .  Db5 . Eb5 .
  track T2 F5 . Ab5 .  Bb5 . Ab5 .  F5 . Eb5 .  Db5 . Bb4 .
  track T3 Ab4 . F4 .  Eb4 . Db4 .  Bb3 . . .  . . . .
  track A1 Bb3 . . .  Db4 . . .  F4 . . .  Bb4 . . .
  track A2 Db5 . . .  F5 . . .  Bb5 . . .  F5 . . .
  track A3 Db5 . . .  Bb4 . . .  F4 . . .  Db4 . . .
  track A4 Bb3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

# The order list: the scale's sections, then the song ends.
audctl $78
speed  11
section ONE OCTAVE
line   .  .     .  O1
line   .  .     .  O2
line   .  .     .  O3
section TWO OCTAVES
line   .  .     .  T1
line   .  .     .  T2
line   .  .     .  T3
section ARPEGGIO
line   .  .     .  A1
line   .  .     .  A2
line   .  .     .  A3
line   .  .     .  A4
end
